===== Hardware mods =====

It is possible to replace the original eeprom and replace it with a Winbond W25Q128JVSIQ. If we currently keep the OEM partition table (for the 64M chip) the device also works with the original firmware. The chip can be easily cloned.
To switch to a larger partition table (RE650 V1), a few steps will be required.


